  "residual": [
    "The modules under `graphical` belong to this package but cannot travel in the headless SDK: their own import closure reaches the window system. The list is checked against the import graph by docker/gen-headless-core.sh, so it cannot go quietly out of date.",
    "Re-homed from the misc pile: the 8 code-generator/decoder backends (AMD64Decoder, ARMDecoder, I386Decoder, PCG386, PCGAMD64, PCGARM, PCA386, PCOFPE) plus the whole PC*/ASM* family \u2014 they are the compiler, not misc.",
    "UNPLACED (a few Fox tools drag them): the GUI documentation/progtool front-ends pull WM* (WMComponents/Dialogs/Editors/TextView/Trees/\u2026) and MemoryReader/PersistentObjects/Versioning/TestSuite. Split those interactive tools into an apps area so the toolchain core stays headless; then this package can go stable."
  ]
